# Data artifacts, model weights, logs and run bundles are now VERSIONED on
# purpose: the training PC has no Claude Code and may get the project by git
# clone rather than a folder copy, so the cached prices/features/GNN scores,
# the trained GNN weights and the news corpus must travel with the repo.
# (Total ~7 MB — well inside GitHub's limits.)

# Python — never commit these: a venv hard-codes absolute paths and breaks on
# any other machine (see CLAUDE.md HANDOFF), and caches are pure noise.
__pycache__/
*.pyc
.venv/
.pytest_cache/
*.egg-info/

# OS / editor
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Session transcript export — kept local (contains working chatter, not project content)
conversation.md
